 CellLabel->
  " Out[24]=",ExpressionUUID->"4f718348-64e8-4a06-befb-f92c726e4ed7"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Figure 8.5  Mass-conserving rate enhancement ",
 StyleBox["k_eff/k_out",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 ". (a) Dependence on the partition coefficients at fixed dense fraction p = \
0.05. (b) Dependence on dense fraction for several K: each curve peaks at p* \
\[TildeTilde] 1/K with a maximum gain of order K/4, far below the open-system \
K\.b2."
}], "Text",
 CellMargins->{{70, 70}, {2, 14}},
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic,
 FontColor->GrayLevel[
  0.35],ExpressionUUID->"8c733be4-2405-44cb-9cb8-d00c2653e7cf"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["9.  Active and chemically-maintained condensates", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"f78e6a7e-5db3-4dc3-bc0f-c8a1ab4bab32"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Living condensates are not at equilibrium: ATP-driven reactions continually \
build up and break down their components. This section extends the model with \
chemistry. Code: ",
 StyleBox["src/active_models.py",
  FontFamily->"Courier"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["src/fh_extensions.py",
  FontFamily->"Courier"],
 ", and ",
 StyleBox["wolfram/active_dynamics.wls",
  FontFamily->"Courier"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"046d1fe1-7e30-41f8-9b17-4084681d7651"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["9.1  Reaction-arrested coarsening", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"5cc3463d-5b6f-46c9-9867-65749a741381"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Add a linear chemical reaction that interconverts droplet material and a \
soluble form, ",
 StyleBox["s(\[Phi]) = k_+(1-\[Phi]) - k_-\[Phi] = -k_react(\[Phi]-\[Phi]_ss)",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 ", to the conserved dynamics:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"28684da2-f944-4762-99b0-d0671198cb89"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   FractionBox[
    RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", "\[Phi]"}], 
    RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", "t"}]], "=", "M", " ", 
   SuperscriptBox["\[Del]", "2"], "\[Mu]", "-", 
   SubscriptBox["k", "react"], 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{"\[Phi]", "-", 
     SubscriptBox["\[Phi]", "ss"]}], ")"}]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormula",
 CellMargins->{{80, 50}, {8, 
  8}},ExpressionUUID->"0b4f5c17-b0a7-45c5-8edc-37ca3191165f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The reaction adds a uniform ",
 StyleBox["-k_react",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 " to the growth rate, ",
 StyleBox["\[Omega](k) = -Mk\.b2(f\[Prime]\[Prime]+\[Kappa]k\.b2) - k_react",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 ", which ",
 StyleBox["stabilises the long-wavelength modes",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 ": the unstable band becomes finite and a length scale is selected. Ostwald \
ripening is arrested and the system settles into a steady-state emulsion \
\[LongDash] the mechanism behind chemically-active droplets (Zwicker et al. \
2015; Bauermann et al. 2025)."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8044353a-bd15-4f8b-a93f-a0520e2c8425"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"figActiveDispersion", "[", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  " In[25]:=",ExpressionUUID->"dd59853d-0c30-45f6-a04f-73bc7af629c5"],

Cell[OutputFormData["\<\
Legended[-Graphics-, Placed[LineLegend[{Directive[Opacity[1.], 
 
