Cell["\<\
Figure 9.3  Stickers-and-spacers spinodal curves. Each curve bounds the \
two-phase region; increasing sticker valence pushes the critical point down \
and outward \[LongDash] multivalency drives liquid\[Dash]liquid phase \
separation even when simple mixing is unfavourable.\
\>", "Text",
 CellMargins->{{70, 70}, {2, 14}},
 FontSize->11,
