  " In[28]:=",ExpressionUUID->"299073ba-a586-4192-93db-d20261e1bd96"],

Cell[OutputFormData["\<\
-Graphics-\
\>"], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9914751684081593`*^9},
 CellLabel->
  " Out[28]=",ExpressionUUID->"dec92cb6-23b3-4c74-a305-33e839d2d590"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Figure 9.4  Thermal-gradient fission (1D Cahn\[Dash]Hilliard, NDSolve). (a) \
At uniform temperature a single domain persists. (b) A central warm band, \
where the well depth a(x) dips below zero, dissolves the neck and splits the \
domain into two daughters \[LongDash] membrane-free division.\
\>", "Text",
 CellMargins->{{70, 70}, {2, 14}},
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic,
 FontColor->GrayLevel[
  0.35],ExpressionUUID->"c80130a8-62f6-48c3-bb86-7f2a9bfe464f"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["9.5  The dispersion surface", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"6f985e21-566a-4cd7-bd51-a0699acaa031"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Finally, the linear-stability result of \[Section]8 viewed as a surface: \
the growth rate ",
 StyleBox["\[Omega](k,\[Phi]_0)",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 " over the whole plane of wavenumber and composition, with the \
neutral-stability ridge ",
 StyleBox["\[Omega]=0",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 " marking the boundary of the unstable region."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"25fca498-3600-4e92-beac-949e40d2731b"],

