Figure 9.5  The Cahn\[Dash]Hilliard dispersion surface \[Omega](k, \[Phi]\
\:2080) for the Flory\[Dash]Huggins free energy. The unstable dome shrinks to \
nothing as the composition approaches the spinodal edge; the cyan curve is \
the neutral-stability ridge.\
\>", "Text",
