 "Figure 10.1  Multi-component spinodals for ",
 StyleBox["N=2,3,5,10",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 " in the Qian\[Dash]Knowles convention; the critical point (white dots) \
migrates as ",
 StyleBox["\[Phi]_c=1/(1+\[Sqrt]N)",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 " toward low concentration and low interaction as the number of components \
grows."
}], "Text",
 CellMargins->{{70, 70}, {2, 14}},
