Cell["\<\
Figure 10.2  Selective compartmentalisation: a ternary (A, B, solvent) free \
energy in which two mutually-repelling solutes form an A-rich and a B-rich \
condensate \[LongDash] each client partitions into the droplet it binds best, \
the physical basis of organelle identity.\
\>", "Text",
 CellMargins->{{70, 70}, {2, 14}},
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic,
 FontColor->GrayLevel[
  0.35],ExpressionUUID->"1088d419-3ad7-4b8d-9ee7-8fc22824ac32"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["10.2  Darwinian selection among protocells", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"06899467-b6aa-4a20-967c-4fd556d2c73a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The intellectual climax. Replicators partition into condensate droplets and \
replicate at a rate set by a heritable genotype ",
 StyleBox["g",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 ", competing for a ",
 StyleBox["shared global nutrient",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " under a uniform chemostat dilution. Replicators whose growth rate ",
 StyleBox["r_0 g",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 " falls below the dilution rate are out-competed (competitive exclusion), \
and the population's mean fitness climbs. A full 2D spatial version (",
 StyleBox["src/darwinian_selection.py",
  FontFamily->"Courier"],
 "), in which fuel-driven droplets grow, divide under periodic thermal \
pulses, and pass their genotype to daughters, reaches the same outcome with \
explicit lineages."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e92cfbbe-e81f-453d-90f1-11836b50953f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The result is natural selection from pure physics.",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " The cargo-weighted mean fitness rises over generations and saturates at a \
mutation-selection balance \[LongDash] no biology is hand-coded; selection is \
an emergent consequence of the dynamics."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7cfeda6a-771c-4417-bcb7-3eee79c892b0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["What the selection requires.",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 " The effect is not automatic: it demands ",
 StyleBox["Malthusian (per-capita) replication competing for a shared, global \
nutrient",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " together with a uniform chemostat dilution. Replacing the shared resource \
with a ",
 StyleBox["local",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 " carrying capacity, or raising the mutation rate too high, erases the \
inheritance signal \[LongDash] mean fitness then drifts rather than climbs \
and selection collapses. The trajectory below is therefore a genuine result \
of the chosen ecology, not a foregone conclusion."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9769d10f-d419-45eb-ad65-d3e600843715"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"figSelectionChemostat", "[", "]"}]], "Input",
